      "scenario": "Twenty accepted scripts leak during independent execution and all twenty pass the complete hygiene gate as tracked-path substitutions. Lexing inserts spaces into word continuations, does not follow &&/||/pipeline continuations and mishandles several valid heredoc forms. Failed exit commands are treated as unconditional termination. typeset +x TMPDIR, stacked noexec flags, quoted/-- chmod modes and integer/uppercase variable attributes also bypass the protections. Seventeen cases pass CI-warning ShellCheck; the other three demonstrate scan gaps with a separate CI diagnostic.",
